      "side": 1,
      "message": "+1 to Kyle proposal, for now doing a copy seems fine as it\u0027s always in cold or opt-in paths. If it becomes an issue in the future, we could make it return a mutex guard for the label (but that\u0027s slightly overkill for now).",
